"body": "dez🐰🐟\n\nHello! Nice to meet you.\n\nI came here to ask for an illustration of my original character \"Your Eden is Here\".\n\n◆Request\nI would like you to draw an illustration for me.\nDetails of the OC are in the reference materials.\n\n◆Composition\nI'll leave it to you!\nThere are a lot of characters, so it's okay if you just draw the face...!\nIt's okay if you simplify the clothes, etc.\n\n◆Reference materials\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1TC8NE_S_DCXGg37POExfe-lXVQHhRRUZ?usp=drive_link\n\nI know you're busy, so it's okay if you don't ask◎\nThank you for your consideration.\nI'll continue to support you!", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kouraiKTM718/works/20", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1518894, "client_id": 1156814, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/da9384c5/uploads/origins/e3b5d268-48ce-44ad-9f9f-21d7cbbdc9a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f351ab237cac6e49f42eed65a1412c5d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/da9384c5/uploads/origins/e3b5d268-48ce-44ad-9f9f-21d7cbbdc9a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f351ab237cac6e49f42eed65a1412c5d, https://si.imgix.net/da9384c5/uploads/origins/e3b5d268-48ce-44ad-9f9f-21d7cbbdc9a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9a63578b403a9aeedb12f108f98842b1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/da9384c5/uploads/origins/e3b5d268-48ce-44ad-9f9f-21d7cbbdc9a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3efd77f1f0f06721d98b1e456bc23ac 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/da9384c5/uploads/origins/e3b5d268-48ce-44ad-9f9f-21d7cbbdc9a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&